```
High Risk Hours:
- 22:00-02:00 (Night) - 40% of crimes
- 18:00-22:00 (Evening) - 30% of crimes

Medium Risk Hours:
- 14:00-18:00 (Afternoon) - 20% of crimes

Low Risk Hours:
- 06:00-14:00 (Morning/Day) - 10% of crimes
```

